{
  "name": "Q&A over Google Drive docs",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Drive document Q&A\n\nLexical retrieval over Google Docs in one folder, then an answer that has to cite those files.\n\n1. Attach Google Drive and OpenAI credentials.\n2. Paste the folder id into Config. It is the last segment of the folder URL.\n3. Docs must be Google Docs. The Download node converts them to plain text.\n4. For a larger corpus, replace Retrieve Passages with a vector store and keep the same answer prompt.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "90dbd80d-c13e-496a-be5d-2cb50399a8ee",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
